These patches modify the Go release pinned in ../default.nix for WASIX:
fixes to the wasip1 runtime and the wasm assembler; sockets, name
resolution and an epoll poller behind the wasix build tag; and WASIX
threads behind GOWASM=threads. They are licensed under the BSD-3-Clause
License (see LICENSE), the same terms as upstream. Context lines, and the
files the series moves or copies, are from upstream and remain the
copyright of their authors under that licence.
